<title>FRANCE: Frenchwomen have longest life expectancy in Europe.</title>
<headline>Frenchwomen have longest life expectancy in Europe.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>French women have the longest life expectancy in Europe, reaching an average age of 81.8 years, according to an official report released on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The report, by the INSEE government statistics office, said French men had a life expectancy of 73.7 years but it did not say how that compared with other countries.</p>
</text>
